                            <comment id="14499448" author="sboikov" created="Fri, 17 Apr 2015 08:15:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;There was small chance of this failure in test where topology constantly changes. Update did not hang forever, but timeout check in atomic cache erroneusly failed update future. I removed timeout check in atomic cache since it is not needed after recovery was implemented in communication. Not able to reproduce this failure anymore.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
